            "review_text": "raulDOAN\nHanoi, Vietnam23 contributions\n0\nModern drinking Vietnamese restaurant\nApr 2024 • Friends\nIt’s a drinking restaurant, but the food are really amazing.\nThe menu is interesting with Vietnamese-based dishes adding some creativity from other cuisines (japanese, chinese, western), and they go really well with all the drinks.\nFor the drink menu they have many things: beer (craft, draught, bottle), Vietnamese liquor, sake and also wine … and personally I found sake is the perfect match\nRead more\nWritten May 2, 2024",
